sequenceDiagram
participant App as Application
participant Cache as Cache
participant DB as Database

App->>Cache: 1. Check cache
alt Cache Miss
Cache-->>App: Not found
App->>DB: 2. Query database
DB-->>App: Return data
App->>Cache: 3. Update cache
Cache-->>App: Confirmed
else Cache Hit
Cache-->>App: Return cached data
end
App->>App: 4. Use data
